   "note": "A bare «عنه» or «وعنه» carrying an Imam blessing («عليه السلام», «عليهما السلام», «عليهم السلام») means the Imam of the chain above, never the human transmitter named before him; carrying «صلى الله عليه وآله» it means the Prophet. If the chain above names no single Imam the step is left unresolved. Decided by the coordinator 2026-10-22: Mishkāt orders narrations from many sources, so the blessing, not the name above, says who «عنه» is."
